Alembic configuration for the backend-petunjukku foundation.

The baseline revision creates the initial relational schema for:

- users
- studio_sessions
- planning_states
- studio_messages
- generated_documents
- audio_records
- ai_logs

The migration environment reads database settings from `app/core/config.py`
and imports model metadata from `app/db/base.py` and `app/models/__init__.py`.
